      "title": "My latest cartoon for New Scientist ",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/038fc7606a59f140dbc093a9c2a3762e/1c0e9c561fa0eea6-82/s640x960/9017cce5fd0deefdff57bbf7a5667ccef03f0f09.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"1042\" data-orig-width=\"1500\" alt=\" A scientist cleans a floor with a mop and bucket. He says: â€œYou know, when I created you, I imagined that you'd do the chores and I'd have more time to do the science.â€  A robot works at a computer. It replies  â€œSilence, human! I am making mathematical history here!  Then adds  â€œAnd don't forget: the bins go out tonight.â€\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/038fc7606a59f140dbc093a9c2a3762e/1c0e9c561fa0eea6-82/s75x75_c1/ef81133eed096ef8f4b668d4325fce279cc00885.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/038fc7606a59f140dbc093a9c2a3762e/1c0e9c561fa0eea6-82/s100x200/426472902c455a2482118f995c5787d8823b45ef.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/038fc7606a59f140dbc093a9c2a3762e/1c0e9c561fa0eea6-82/s250x400/c140a8107480d52d75452df085fc0f0833e27453.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/038fc7606a59f140dbc093a9c2a3762e/1c0e9c561fa0eea6-82/s400x600/3df17099de0adcc4661c4a4c371b1508a5772bab.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/038fc7606a59f140dbc093a9c2a3762e/1c0e9c561fa0eea6-82/s500x750/907737d76205be70ab54ae46218c3b75172b7048.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/038fc7606a59f140dbc093a9c2a3762e/1c0e9c561fa0eea6-82/s540x810/aaa1c262045e8fb27518f8c3d32e2a7bb63b2daa.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/038fc7606a59f140dbc093a9c2a3762e/1c0e9c561fa0eea6-82/s640x960/9017cce5fd0deefdff57bbf7a5667ccef03f0f09.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/038fc7606a59f140dbc093a9c2a3762e/1c0e9c561fa0eea6-82/s1280x1920/02804ae7ae88fa351038be3afc172e992efae005.jpg 1280w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/038fc7606a59f140dbc093a9c2a3762e/1c0e9c561fa0eea6-82/s2048x3072/156767a5640d760d38e6ff2756d4409c050c5741.jpg 1500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\"/>"
